  "examples": [
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "충신은 효자 가문에서 나온다",
      "text": "A <b>filial</b> son makes a loyal subject."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "효도하고 싶을 때는 이미 부모님은  안 계신다",
      "text": "When one would be <b>filial</b>, one's parents are gone. or A son neverthinks of his parents until it is too late."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그는 어머니에 대한 효성이 지극하다",
      "text": "He shows the greatest devotion to his mother. or He is very <b>filial</b> to his mother. or He is extremely devoted to his mother."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그것이 자식된 길이다",
      "text": "That's a <b>filial</b> duty."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "효는 백행의 근본이다",
      "text": "<b>Filial</b> piety is the source of all virtues."
    }
